                        Security trail / 02\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"aurora-heading mt-1 text-[25px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-2\" id=\"timeline-title\">\n                            Sự kiện gần đây\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"aurora-focus text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#F94D00] underline underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                        Xem tất cả\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-[8px] top-8 w-px bg-[#d9d2ca]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex gap-4 pb-7\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"z-10 mt-1 h-[17px] w-[17px] border-4 border-[#FFFAFA] bg-[#F94D00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.11em] text-[#F94D00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    Cảnh báo · 2 phút trước\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[16px] text-[#F94D00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-bold text-[#002387]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                                SIM card changed\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#66709a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2-3\">